'''Dathcha''' was a [[Jawa]] who lived on the [[desert]] [[planet]] [[Tatooine]].<ref name="Complete Locations" /> In [[1 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{FilmDate|IV|1}}</ref> Dathcha led a group of Jawas in the [[Jundland Wastes]], where they captured the [[astromech droid]] [[R2-D2]].<ref name="Complete Locations" /> Dathcha was famous for taunting a [[krayt dragon]] and living to tell the tale.<ref name="Dathcha's Card" />

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Dathcha first appeared in the [[1977]] film [[Star Wars: Episode IV A New Hope|''Star Wars'': Episode IV ''A New Hope'']],<ref name="ANH">{{Film|IV}}</ref> and was played by [[Tiffany L. Kurtz|Tiffany Kurtz]] (then 6 years old), daughter of producer [[Gary Kurtz]],<ref name="Much to Learn">{{SW|url=news/much-to-learn-you-still-have-7-things-you-might-not-know-about-jawas|text=Much to Learn You Still Have: 7 Things You Might Not Know About Jawas}}</ref> though she was uncredited.<ref name="ANH" />

